	"docs.articles.adventure-mcp.every-item-rule-requires-an-exact-item-key":
		'Every item rule requires an exact item key and a positive <span class="dlabel">maxItemValue</span>. Upgrade and compound rules also require a maximum level and have per-session attempt caps. Listing rules require an exact level, keep quantity, trade slot, price, quantity, and value ceiling. Locked, special-property, and stat-modified items are excluded. The code locates inventory entries again immediately before a mutation because inventory indexes can change.',
