	"docs.articles.adventure-mcp.mainframe-link-character-directly-starts-one-character-in":
		'<span class="dlabel">mainframe_link_character</span> directly starts one character in a dedicated machine and prepays one 60-minute window. When <span class="dlabel">mainframe_get_dashboard</span> includes <span class="dlabel">free_time</span>, Mainframe uses those shared Steam hours before charging Shells. Each direct link consumes time separately. The assignment renews automatically, survives Adventure Land HTTP restarts, Mainframe controller restarts, host maintenance, and machine replacement, and stops only after <span class="dlabel">mainframe_disconnect_character</span> or when the account cannot pay the next renewal.',
