	"docs.articles.adventure-mcp.read-from-character-g-server-game-and-smart":
		'Read from <span class="dlabel">character</span>, <span class="dlabel">G</span>, <span class="dlabel">server</span>, <span class="dlabel">game</span>, and <span class="dlabel">smart</span>. UI drawing and button functions do not provide useful output on Mainframe. General network calls, Node internals, process execution, and filesystem access are unavailable. <span class="dlabel">smart_move</span> keeps its public interface but uses Mainframe navigation.',
