	// docs/articles/adventure-mcp.html:158; Documentation td prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["G","character","parent.entities"].
	"docs.articles.adventure-mcp.records-in-g-describe-classes-skills-items-monsters":
		'Records in <span class="dlabel">G</span> describe classes, skills, items, monsters, maps, drops, recipes, and other content. The live <span class="dlabel">character</span>, <span class="dlabel">parent.entities</span>, server events, and action responses describe what exists now. A definition is not proof that an entity is present or an action succeeded.',
	// docs/articles/adventure-mcp.html:305; Documentation td prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Keep names: ["CODE"].
	"docs.articles.adventure-mcp.replace-the-current-browser-code-runner-with-a": "Replace the current browser CODE runner with a saved slot.",
