	"docs.articles.adventure-mcp.requested-action-counts-show-what-code-attempted-not":
		'Requested action counts show what CODE attempted, not what the game accepted. Confirm behavior through observations: connection state, disconnect reason, map, coordinates, movement, target, activity, death state, experience, gold, DPS, gold per second, and CODE logs. Use <span class="dlabel">mainframe_get_events</span> to distinguish Mainframe starts, renewal, recovery, restarts, server changes, and explicit stops from character CODE output. Both journals remain readable for 30 days after the worker stops. Poll slowly; combat timing belongs inside CODE.',
