	// docs/articles/data-monster.html:99; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
	"docs.articles.data-monster.definitions-and-spawn-packs": '<span class="dlabel">Definitions and spawn packs</span>',
	// docs/articles/data-monster.html:104; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["G.maps[map].monsters"].
	"docs.articles.data-monster.g-maps-map-monsters-describes-spawn-packs-and":
		'<span class="dlabel">G.maps[map].monsters</span> describes spawn packs and boundaries. A definition or pack is not proof that a particular monster is currently alive or visible; use live entity helpers for action code.',
