	// docs/articles/data-npc.html:27; Documentation div prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["side_interaction"].
	"docs.articles.data-npc.side-interaction-contextual-dialogue-displayed-beside-a-specialist": '<span class="dlabel">side_interaction</span> — contextual dialogue displayed beside a specialist grid.',
	// docs/articles/data-npc.html:22; Documentation div prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["skin"].
