	// docs/articles/events-game.html:170; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["pvp_list","ccreport"].
