	"docs.functions.load_code.errors-the-optional-onerror-is-a-script-load":
		"<b>Errors:</b> The optional <span class='dlabel'>onerror</span> is a script-load error callback. Syntax or runtime errors inside a loaded browser script are reported globally; they do not call this callback or throw into the calling code, which can continue running.",
