	"docs.functions.load_code.load-shared-dependencies-once-from-the-character-slot":
		"Load shared dependencies once from the character slot, before the scripts that use them. Calling <span class='dlabel'>load_code</span> from each dependent file does not skip files that have already run. Circular loading chains are not detected.",
	// docs/functions/load_code.html:4; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["const","let","class","var"].
	"docs.functions.load_code.repeated-calls-every-call-executes-the-file-again":
		"<b>Repeated calls:</b> Every call executes the file again. Repeated top-level <span class='dlabel'>const</span>, <span class='dlabel'>let</span>, or <span class='dlabel'>class</span> declarations can fail with an <span class='dlabel'>Identifier has already been declared</span> error. Repeated <span class='dlabel'>var</span> initializers can reset values; initialization can also create duplicate timers or listeners.",
	// docs/functions/load_code.html:3; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
