	"docs.functions.use_skill.example": "<b>Example:</b>",
	// docs/functions/use_skill.html:5; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
	"docs.functions.use_skill.notes-targets-may-be-entity-objects-character-names":
		"<b>Notes:</b> Targets may be entity objects, character names, monster IDs, coordinate arrays for blink, or arrays for multi-target skills. If target is omitted, get_target() is used. Multi-target skills return one Promise, not an array. The optional timed-action timeout defaults to 20,000ms. Final timed-action results include response, place, request_id, and success; fishing/mining also include found.",
	// docs/functions/use_skill.html:12; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["\"bulwark\"","\"sanctuary\"","\"zeal\"","\"warding\""].
	"docs.functions.use_skill.paladin-aura-at-level-60-pass-the-aura":
		"<b>Paladin Aura:</b> At level 60, pass the aura state as the second argument, not extra_arg. Choose <span class='dlabel'>\"bulwark\"</span> (armor and HP), <span class='dlabel'>\"sanctuary\"</span> (resistance and MP), <span class='dlabel'>\"zeal\"</span> (damage output and attack frequency), or <span class='dlabel'>\"warding\"</span> (elemental and status resistances, and reduced MP costs).",
	// docs/functions/use_skill.html:4; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["failed: true","reason","mode_resolve_all()"].
	"docs.functions.use_skill.promise-failures-unless-a-function-specific-note-says":
		"<b>Promise failures:</b> Unless a function-specific note says otherwise, failures reject with an object containing <span class='dlabel'>failed: true</span> and a <span class='dlabel'>reason</span>. After <span class='dlabel'>mode_resolve_all()</span>, the same failures fulfill instead.",
	// docs/functions/use_skill.html:3; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
	"docs.functions.use_skill.returns-one-promise-pickpocket-fishing-and-mining-wait":
		"<b>Returns:</b> One Promise. Pickpocket, fishing, and mining wait for their final result. Other skills resolve when the server accepts the skill request; a projectile may still be in flight.",
	// docs/functions/use_skill.html:22; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Locked inline code: ["G.skills.paladin_aura.states"].
	"docs.functions.use_skill.switching-costs-no-mp-and-has-a-500ms":
		"Switching costs no MP and has a 500ms cooldown. The aura stays active passively; do not recast it to refresh its 60-second condition. Switching removes your previous aura's contribution immediately. Only the strongest nearby source of each state applies, while different states from different Paladins can coexist. See <span class='dlabel'>G.skills.paladin_aura.states</span> for the stat values.",
	// docs/functions/use_skill.html:2; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged.
	"docs.functions.use_skill.uses-a-named-skill-with-an-optional-target": "Uses a named skill with an optional target and skill-specific extra argument.",
	// docs/functions/wait_for.html:6; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
