	"docs.functions.wait_for.notes-defaults-are-a-10-000ms-timeout-and":
		"<b>Notes:</b> Defaults are a 10,000ms timeout and 50ms interval. The overall deadline also covers a condition Promise that never finishes. Timeout and interval values below zero are clamped to zero.",
