	"docs.guide.event-holidayseason.grinch-is-a-trickster-he-portals-to-you":
		"<span class='spgrinch'></span> Grinch is a trickster. He portals to you, steals your gold, and escapes before he can be defeated! Make sure you are never alone. Defeating Grinch requires a lot of planning, as he doesn't stay long in one place and can heal himself. When he spawns, he already has 12,000,000+ gold in his pockets!\n\t\t<br />\n\t\t<br />\n\t\tDealing 400,000 damage to Grinch unlocks the Festive achievement and a title reward for your equipped cape, so make sure you target him whenever he teleports to you!",
	// docs/guide/event-holidayseason.html:2; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Keep names: ["Adventure Land"].
