	"docs.guide.event-valentines.candy-pop-s-drop-globally-you-can-eat": "Candy Pop's drop globally. You can eat them or exchange them from Xyn in Mainland.",
	// docs/guide/event-valentines.html:9; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only. Keep names: ["Goo","Love Goo"].
	"docs.guide.event-valentines.love-goo-spawns-every-hour-in-a-random":
		"<span class='sppinkgoo'></span> Love Goo spawns every hour in a random map and inside a random monster pack. Love Goo is co-op but has 98% avoidance, so it's a bit tricky to land a hit! :)",
