	"docs.guide.npc-merrit.set-up-shop-any-class-can-take-part":
		"<b>Set up shop</b>Any class can take part. Open a stand with an item for sale or a buy order funded for at least one unit. Giveaways alone don't count.",
	// docs/guide/npc-merrit.html:9; Documentation p prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
	"docs.guide.npc-merrit.she-must-walk-within-32px-with-a-clear": "She must walk within <b>32px with a clear path</b> to deliver. Following her and opening a stand won't skip the two-minute wait.",
	// docs/guide/npc-merrit.html:37; Documentation th prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged.
	"docs.guide.npc-merrit.shells-before-the-visit": "SHELLS before the visit",
