	"docs.guide.npc-merrit.sometimes-merrit-adds-1-shell-directly-to-your":
		"Sometimes Merrit adds <b>1 SHELL</b> directly to your account. Below 10 SHELLS, the chance is higher and falls as your balance approaches 10.",
	// docs/guide/npc-merrit.html:7; Documentation div prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
	"docs.guide.npc-merrit.stay-two-minutes-keep-your-stock-and-your":
		"<b>Stay two minutes</b>Keep your stock and your spot for two continuous minutes. Your account can receive one parcel per hour, across all characters and servers.",
