	"docs.guide.pvp.a-safe-room-can-still-exist-on-a":
		'A safe room can still exist on a PVP server. Your party and team are protected from ordinary friendly fire, but strangers are not. Store spare gold and inspect every <span class="guide-pvp">^</span>-marked item before leaving safety.',
