	"docs.guide.pvp.in-pvp-reports-whether-your-character-is-presently":
		'<span class="dlabel">in_pvp()</span> reports whether your character is presently exposed. <span class="dlabel">server.pvp</span> tells you whether the whole server is PVP, while <span class="dlabel">G.maps[character.map].pvp</span> describes the current map.',
	// docs/guide/pvp.html:7; Documentation div prose block. Keep Adventure Land, CODE symbols, and item/NPC/map/monster names unchanged. Fixed HTML: preserve every tag, attribute, handler and URL exactly; translate visible prose only.
	"docs.guide.pvp.know-what-can-be-lost-open-pvp-can":
		'<b>Know what can be lost</b>Open PVP can cost gold, experience, and <span class="guide-pvp">^</span>-marked items. Safe arenas and private duels use different defeat rules.',
